==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bannerman Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the opening Dark Doges with an [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]]. Once it triggers the boss wave, lure the Dark enemies over to your base and try to stunlock them with [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] while trying to kill them with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]]/[[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]].

